From d58a1a1fd812df24c0ff8d844daabba754cded2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stephano Cetola <stephano@cetola.net>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 18:15:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/20] arm: rk3588s: pocket-reform-rcm5: enable xHCI keyboard

Enable the xHCI USB host controller in barebox for the Radxa CM5
(RK3588S2) board.

Add usbdp_phy0 and usb_host0_xhci. The keyboard (1209:6d06, Pocket
Reform Input 1.0) sits behind two USB hubs on the xhci-hcd bus.
Without usbdp_phy0 + usb_host0_xhci, barebox has no xHCI controller
and the entire hub chain is unreachable.

Signed-off-by: Stephano Cetola <stephano@cetola.net>
---
 .../dts/rk3588s-mnt-pocket-reform-rcm5.dts    | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/rk3588s-mnt-pocket-reform-rcm5.dts b/arch/arm/dts/rk3588s-mnt-pocket-reform-rcm5.dts
index ee496819e0..28791fa5ef 100644
--- a/arch/arm/dts/rk3588s-mnt-pocket-reform-rcm5.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/rk3588s-mnt-pocket-reform-rcm5.dts
@@ -220,6 +220,15 @@
 	};
 };

+&usbdp_phy0 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&usb_host0_xhci {
+	dr_mode = "host";
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &hdptxphy0 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
--
2.43.0
